        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Flows&lt;/b&gt; &amp;#9312; Route 53 resolves the app name to the ALB (alias) and health-checks /health. &amp;#9313; HTTPS from users is inspected by AWS WAF on the ALB. &amp;#9314; ALB forwards to EC2 instances in private subnets of both AZs. &amp;#9315; Instances query RDS PostgreSQL (Multi-AZ, automatic failover). &amp;#9316; Browsers fetch /static/* from CloudFront; the S3 origin is private (OAC). &amp;#9317; Instances reach the internet only via the NAT gateway in their own AZ. &amp;#9318; Operators use Session Manager &amp;#8212; no SSH port, no bastion; alarms notify via SNS email.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Defence in depth&lt;/b&gt; AWS WAF &amp;#8594; security-group chain (alb &amp;#8594; app &amp;#8594; db) &amp;#8594; per-tier NACLs &amp;#8594; private subnets (data tier has no internet route) &amp;#8594; IMDSv2, encrypted EBS / RDS / S3." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fillColor=#FAFAFA;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="1400" width="1610" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
